              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "smmoore"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was great. I used Meyer lemons because they were on sale. To reduce the calories I uses Equal sugar &amp; reduced fat butter. I also increased the lemon zest to suit my taste.",
            "datePublished": "2018-02-04T22:22:48.020Z"
